    "text": "The Experience Battle was Battle Carnival 2011's corner for beginners and young players, in Osaka on 5 and 6 November and in Tokyo on 19 and 20 November 2011, where they learned the game with guidance and borrowed 30-card or 60-card decks. Everyone who joined got a sticker of the event's key art, and players who finished a battle with each deck size got an oversize jumbo Mewtwo."
